#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:4
msgid "Container Registry Integration"
msgstr "Container-Registry-Integration"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Übersicht"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides container registry integration within Kubernetes "
"clusters through the ``KubernetesRegistryService``. This allows "
"Kubernetes workloads to pull images from private container registries "
"configured in |morpheus|."
msgstr "|morpheus| bietet Container-Registry-Integration in Kubernetes-Clustern über den ``KubernetesRegistryService``. So können Kubernetes-Arbeitslasten Images aus in |morpheus| konfigurierten privaten Container-Registries ziehen."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:11
msgid ""
"Container registries are managed as Docker Registry integrations and can "
"be associated with Kubernetes clusters to enable authenticated image "
"pulls."
msgstr "Container-Registries werden als Docker-Registry-Integrationen verwaltet und können Kubernetes-Clustern zugeordnet werden, um authentifizierte Image-Pulls zu ermöglichen."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:14
msgid "Configuring Registry Integrations"
msgstr "Registry-Integrationen konfigurieren"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:17
msgid "Adding a Docker Registry"
msgstr "Docker Registry hinzufügen"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:19
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navigieren Sie zu ``Infrastructure > Integrations``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:20
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Wählen Sie :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/kubernetes/registry.rst:21
msgid "Choose **Docker Registry**"
msgstr "Wählen Sie **Docker Registry**"

